    "summary": "At the end of the opponent’s [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), pick one **visible** enemy unit up to 36″ away from this unit, other than **MONSTER**, **VEHICLE** and [Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative) units, then roll a D6 for it. On a 2+, it suffers D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds), and until your next turn is over it cannot be **hidden** and ranged attacks targeting it have [[IGNORES COVER]](vsdata:weapon-ability/ignores-cover).",
